<import src="../../templates/common.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="header" data="{{title:'隐私删除',error,loading,busy,pending}}"/><view class="card"><view>删除前请核对影响范围。相关消息和分析结果可能一起清理，其他独立记录会保留。</view><view class="muted">应用内导出副本会同步清理；已经分享到其他位置的文件需要自行删除。</view><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onPreview">查看删除范围</button></view><view wx:if="{{state}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">影响范围</view><view wx:if="{{wrongBase}}" class="warning">此预览属于另一服务，请切回原地址。</view><view class="muted">对象：{{state.preview.target_type === 'event' ? '健康记录' : '长期信息'}}</view><view wx:for="{{counts}}" wx:key="key" class="field">{{item.label}}：{{item.count}}</view><view wx:for="{{state.preview.reasons}}" wx:key="*this" class="warning">{{item}}</view><view wx:if="{{state.preview.scope === 'legacy_context'}}" class="warning">部分旧记录关联信息不完整，可能需要清理更多相关内容。</view><block wx:if="{{state.result}}"><view class="subtitle">{{state.result.state === 'completed' ? '清理已完成' : '清理尚未完成'}}</view><button wx:if="{{state.result.state === 'pending'}}" disabled="{{busy}}" data-retry="{{true}}" bindtap="onStatus">继续清理</button><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onStatus">查看清理进度</button></block><button wx:else class="danger" disabled="{{busy || pending || wrongBase}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="onExecute">确认以上范围并删除</button></view><template is="footer" data="{{busy,loading}}"/></view>
